      "Among ETFs tracking benchmark indexes, the SPDR S&P 500 ETF (SPY) fell 0.4%, and Invesco QQQ Trust (QQQ) ended Tuesday around 1.1% lower, while the SPDR Dow Jones Industrial Average ETF Trust (DIA) ended flat.",
